WEBVTT

00:00:03.061 --> 00:00:04.312
(Sloths groaning)

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.107
Manny, are you okay?

00:00:07.190 --> 00:00:08.483
(pained grunting)

00:00:08.566 --> 00:00:09.442
Huh?

00:00:09.526 --> 00:00:13.405
-Get off my face.
-Ow. (grunts)

00:00:13.738 --> 00:00:14.823
-(laughing)
-That was fun.

00:00:14.906 --> 00:00:15.782
(screams)

00:00:15.865 --> 00:00:17.409
Now, who should I eat first?

00:00:17.492 --> 00:00:18.493
Ooh! (grunts)

00:00:18.576 --> 00:00:20.662
-(growling)
-No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:00:20.745 --> 00:00:23.665
Wah, wah, wah, wah, wah...
wah... wah... wah! Wah.

00:00:23.748 --> 00:00:25.750
SID: Uncle Fungus!
Could that really be you?

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:28.086
-Ow!
-Sorry, sorry.

00:00:28.169 --> 00:00:29.170
(gasps)

00:00:29.254 --> 00:00:31.840
Mom, Dad!

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:33.383
Marshall.

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:34.509
-GRANNY: Hey!
-Granny?

00:00:34.592 --> 00:00:35.969
This pumpkin's ripe
for picking.

00:00:36.052 --> 00:00:36.886
Ow!

00:00:36.970 --> 00:00:39.055
Oh, my whole familia.

00:00:39.389 --> 00:00:41.015
See, he still hugs
his parents.

00:00:41.099 --> 00:00:43.601
SID'S MOM: I never thought
I'd see my little baby again.

00:00:43.685 --> 00:00:46.104
We've been searching
everywhere for you.

00:00:46.187 --> 00:00:47.105
You have?

00:00:47.188 --> 00:00:48.857
I knew it! I knew it!

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:50.608
Deep down, I knew
I wasn't abandoned.

00:00:50.692 --> 00:00:52.110
(chuckling):
Oh, that's incorrect.

00:00:52.193 --> 00:00:53.820
We totally abandoned you.

00:00:53.903 --> 00:00:56.698
-But we always missed you.
-(grunts)

00:00:56.781 --> 00:00:57.824
-Ow!
-Right?

00:00:57.907 --> 00:00:59.868
Oh, uh, yeah.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:00.285 --> 00:01:02.704
And we just knew Sid
would want to see his...

00:01:02.787 --> 00:01:06.958
poor, dear Granny
before... her time is up.

00:01:07.041 --> 00:01:10.378
I'll bury you all
and dance on your grave.

00:01:10.462 --> 00:01:11.379
So frail.

00:01:11.463 --> 00:01:14.757
And she can't wait to
spend time with you, Sid.

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.302
Oh, yeah.
Uh, uh, uh, Granny?

00:01:17.385 --> 00:01:18.303
Granny?

00:01:21.806 --> 00:01:22.640
(sniffing)

00:01:22.724 --> 00:01:24.184
-(laughing)
-Ow!

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:25.101
Granny...

00:01:25.185 --> 00:01:26.811
I never get
to have any fun.

00:01:27.228 --> 00:01:29.147
Why don't you show her
your cave, hmm?

00:01:29.230 --> 00:01:30.648
Yeah, she could use a nap.

00:01:30.732 --> 00:01:32.567
Boy, there's so much
to tell you.

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:34.527
You know, a lot has happened
since the last time I saw you.

00:01:34.611 --> 00:01:35.945
Not interested.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:38.323
But we fought dinosaurs
in the Ice Age.

00:01:38.406 --> 00:01:39.491
It didn't make sense,

00:01:39.574 --> 00:01:40.533
but it sure was exciting.

00:01:40.617 --> 00:01:41.493
(cheering)

00:01:41.993 --> 00:01:43.870
We got rid of the crazy bat!
Let's go!

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:45.413
(grunting)

00:01:45.997 --> 00:01:47.040
MANNY:
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:01:47.123 --> 00:01:48.124
You can't just leave.

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:49.792
Sid will be crushed.
Whoa, whoa.

00:01:49.876 --> 00:01:52.045
Sorry, cookie. Things are
breaking apart back home.

00:01:52.128 --> 00:01:55.298
So we're headed inland,
and Granny is just dead weight.

00:01:55.381 --> 00:01:57.091
-See you.
-Mush! Mush!

00:01:57.175 --> 00:01:58.051
(whooping and hollering)

00:01:58.134 --> 00:02:01.846
And warn the community:
she tends to wander.

00:02:02.972 --> 00:02:05.141
Well, that explains
a lot about Sid.

00:02:05.558 --> 00:02:07.268
SID: Mom, Dad, do you
have Granny's teeth?

00:02:07.352 --> 00:02:08.770
She can't find them.

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.734
Hey, can you chew
this thing for me?

00:02:14.817 --> 00:02:16.486
Ew. Guys?

00:02:16.861 --> 00:02:18.112
Where is everyone?

00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:19.948
I'll handle this.

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.368
Sid. (clears throat)

00:02:23.451 --> 00:02:26.287
Uh, your family was wiped out
by an asteroid. Sorry.

00:02:26.371 --> 00:02:27.622
-What?!
-(Manny clears throat)

00:02:27.705 --> 00:02:32.794
What Diego is trying
to say is, they left.

00:02:33.294 --> 00:02:36.214
They only wanted to find you so
you could take care of Granny.

00:02:36.297 --> 00:02:37.340
Oh, come on.

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:39.092
Come on. I mean,
what kind of sick family

00:02:39.175 --> 00:02:41.344
would ditch their old granny
on someone?

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:43.054
(chuckling):
That's just crazy.

00:02:43.137 --> 00:02:47.016
That's just... that's just...

00:02:47.725 --> 00:02:49.227
my family.

00:02:49.852 --> 00:02:51.771
Well, at least you
still have Granny.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:54.274
-Right, buddy?
-Yeah. Granny.

00:02:54.816 --> 00:02:55.650
Granny?

00:02:56.109 --> 00:02:57.443
-Granny?
-Wow.

00:02:57.777 --> 00:02:59.654
For an old girl,
she moves fast.

00:03:01.614 --> 00:03:04.242
(rumbling)

00:03:04.325 --> 00:03:05.994
-SID: Granny!
-DIEGO: Granny!

00:03:06.077 --> 00:03:07.161
MANNY:
Granny!

00:03:07.245 --> 00:03:08.580
SID: Come out, come out,
wherever you are.

00:03:08.663 --> 00:03:09.706
MANNY:
Come on, Granny.

00:03:09.789 --> 00:03:11.457
Here, Granny, Granny,
Granny, Granny.

00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:14.335
I have prunes for you.

00:03:14.419 --> 00:03:16.629
Just the way you like them.

00:03:16.713 --> 00:03:18.214
(retches)

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:20.091
-I don't want to see that.
-(groans)

00:03:20.174 --> 00:03:21.009
Huh?

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:24.846
Oh, no.

00:03:25.263 --> 00:03:26.931
What if your dad finds out?

00:03:27.015 --> 00:03:28.224
I'm not as tough as I look.

00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:29.934
Wait. Shh.
Do you hear that?

00:03:30.018 --> 00:03:31.894
(music playing,
teens chatting and laughing)

00:03:38.234 --> 00:03:39.068
Go long!

00:03:39.569 --> 00:03:40.403
(grunts)

00:03:40.486 --> 00:03:42.280
Yes! (chuckles)

00:03:43.573 --> 00:03:45.199
Cool! (screams)

00:03:45.283 --> 00:03:46.701
Hey, look, there's Ethan.

00:03:47.368 --> 00:03:48.911
GIRLS: Yeah, Ethan!

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.121
You go, boy.

00:03:50.204 --> 00:03:52.498
-Ah, that was nice.
-(whooping)

00:03:52.832 --> 00:03:53.833
(gasps)

00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:55.668
Yeah!

00:03:55.752 --> 00:03:56.836
(grunts)

00:03:57.879 --> 00:03:59.881
See? Fun. No danger.

00:03:59.964 --> 00:04:01.841
Whoo-hoo! Yeah!

00:04:01.924 --> 00:04:03.092
Check me out!

00:04:03.801 --> 00:04:05.011
Yeah!

00:04:05.094 --> 00:04:06.638
(screaming)

00:04:06.721 --> 00:04:07.889
(all groan)

00:04:07.972 --> 00:04:09.349
(groans weakly)

00:04:09.932 --> 00:04:11.017
I'm sure he's fine.

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.686
TEEN ELK:
I'm completely not fine!

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:14.771
(groaning)

00:04:14.854 --> 00:04:16.481
Oh, you did not
just do that.

00:04:16.564 --> 00:04:18.149
That was crazy.

00:04:19.651 --> 00:04:20.943
Nice.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:22.362
-Yeah!
-(crowd cheering)

00:04:22.445 --> 00:04:23.738
(coughs)

00:04:23.821 --> 00:04:25.406
PEACHES: Isn't he perfect?

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.950
Perfect? You know, it's...
it's such a strong word.

00:04:28.034 --> 00:04:29.118
Maybe adequate.

00:04:29.202 --> 00:04:30.203
-(gasps)
-Who are we stalking?

00:04:30.286 --> 00:04:31.537
Is it Ethan?
I bet it's Ethan.

00:04:31.621 --> 00:04:33.373
-Oh, hey, Wiener.
-What are you guys doing here?

00:04:33.456 --> 00:04:34.874
Manny told us
to keep an eye on you.

00:04:34.957 --> 00:04:37.794
-But not to let you see us.
-Under any circumstances.

00:04:38.211 --> 00:04:39.170
Oh!

00:04:39.253 --> 00:04:42.090
BOTH: Stupid, stupid, stupid,
stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid!

00:04:42.173 --> 00:04:43.841
Okay. I'm going for it.

00:04:44.425 --> 00:04:45.718
Do I look okay?

00:04:46.386 --> 00:04:47.261
Louis?

00:04:48.846 --> 00:04:51.808
"Okay" doesn't even begin
to cover it.

00:04:51.891 --> 00:04:53.351
Oh, Louis.

00:04:53.434 --> 00:04:55.144
You're the greatest
friend ever.

00:04:57.146 --> 00:04:58.481
(sighs)

00:04:58.564 --> 00:04:59.857
That's me.

00:04:59.941 --> 00:05:02.026
Hi, Ethan.
My name's Peaches.

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:03.236
What's yours?

00:05:03.319 --> 00:05:04.946
(groans)
What am I doing?

00:05:05.029 --> 00:05:06.364
Okay, just be cool.

00:05:06.447 --> 00:05:08.282
Just be... (screams)

00:05:09.701 --> 00:05:11.202
(grunts) No!

00:05:11.285 --> 00:05:12.662
(whimpers)

00:05:12.745 --> 00:05:14.872
(laughs) That's intense.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:16.666
(screaming)

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:18.042
(grunts) Ow, ow.

00:05:18.126 --> 00:05:19.419
This hurts so much.

00:05:19.502 --> 00:05:21.212
Ow. (gasps) No.

00:05:21.295 --> 00:05:23.673
No, no, no, no...!

00:05:26.551 --> 00:05:27.719
-(grunts)
-(crowd gasping)

00:05:28.636 --> 00:05:29.470
GIRL: Gross.

00:05:29.554 --> 00:05:32.765
It's that weirdo who
chills with possums.

00:05:32.849 --> 00:05:35.017
Oh, what just happened?

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:37.478
Oh, no.
Ethan, I am so sorry.

00:05:37.562 --> 00:05:39.105
I... Wow.

00:05:39.188 --> 00:05:40.648
You're even better-looking
up close.

00:05:40.732 --> 00:05:42.525
-Phenomenal. I mean...
-Uh...

00:05:43.234 --> 00:05:44.569
ETHAN: You have a twin sister?

00:05:45.278 --> 00:05:47.113
Am I interrupting
something?

00:05:47.196 --> 00:05:48.030
-(gasps)
-Dad!

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:48.948
Oh, boy. Okay. Uh...

00:05:49.031 --> 00:05:50.783
Sorry if I just...
Oh, wait, no, no, you go left.

00:05:50.867 --> 00:05:52.326
-No, just move back a bit.
-Not good.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:54.412
You, keep away
from my daughter.

00:05:54.495 --> 00:05:55.663
-Dad, nothing...
-And you!

00:05:55.747 --> 00:05:56.789
-You're grounded.
-But I didn't do...

00:05:56.873 --> 00:05:58.040
Grounded.

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:59.417
-BOY: Loser alert.
-GIRL: Grounded!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.419
-Ouch.
-That's her dad.

00:06:01.502 --> 00:06:03.337
Seriously, that's embarrassing.

00:06:03.421 --> 00:06:05.173
-Mm-hmm.
-What a freak.

00:06:05.256 --> 00:06:06.090
(whimpers softly)

00:06:06.841 --> 00:06:08.050
Peaches.

00:06:10.511 --> 00:06:11.804
(groans)

00:06:11.888 --> 00:06:13.973
Peaches, come on.
Let's talk about this.

00:06:14.056 --> 00:06:16.768
How could you embarrass me
in front of my friends?

00:06:16.851 --> 00:06:19.604
You deliberately went where
you weren't supposed to.

00:06:19.687 --> 00:06:21.689
Ugh! You can't
control my life.

00:06:21.773 --> 00:06:23.483
I'm trying to protect you.

00:06:23.566 --> 00:06:24.692
That's what fathers do.

00:06:24.776 --> 00:06:25.610
Well...

00:06:26.194 --> 00:06:28.070
I wish you weren't my father.

00:06:31.157 --> 00:06:32.575
She's just upset, honey.

00:06:33.284 --> 00:06:35.745
Peaches, it's not
the end of the world.

00:06:35.828 --> 00:06:37.038
(rumbling)

00:06:37.121 --> 00:06:37.955
(gasps)

00:06:38.039 --> 00:06:39.040
(birds screeching)

00:06:41.584 --> 00:06:43.211
Whoa. Excuse me.

00:06:43.294 --> 00:06:44.796
I don't think that was you.

00:06:47.799 --> 00:06:48.841
(creaking)

00:06:48.925 --> 00:06:50.510
ELLIE: Uh, what was that?

00:06:50.593 --> 00:06:51.469
I don't know.

00:06:52.053 --> 00:06:53.179
Stay there.

00:06:53.679 --> 00:06:54.972
I'll come to you.

00:06:55.431 --> 00:06:56.599
(wind whistling)

00:06:56.682 --> 00:06:58.810
(creaking)

00:06:58.893 --> 00:07:00.102
(both screaming)

00:07:00.436 --> 00:07:01.270
(grunts)

00:07:01.354 --> 00:07:02.396
(screaming)

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.858
-Ellie!
-Manny!

00:07:05.942 --> 00:07:07.610
(both grunting)

00:07:07.693 --> 00:07:09.028
-No!
-(Peaches gasps)

00:07:10.988 --> 00:07:12.698
-Dad!
-Peaches, get back!

00:07:12.782 --> 00:07:13.908
Whoa!

00:07:14.742 --> 00:07:16.160
(screaming)

00:07:18.162 --> 00:07:19.163
(panting)

00:07:19.872 --> 00:07:20.957
(grunting)

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.291
Hurry, Dad! Hurry!

00:07:22.375 --> 00:07:23.209
DIEGO: Manny!

00:07:23.292 --> 00:07:24.585
(grunts) Diego!

00:07:24.669 --> 00:07:26.003
You never would
have made it.

